WEBVTT

00:10:58.455 --> 00:11:02.740
Lucy lost her son to gun violence,

00:11:02.764 --> 00:11:06.709
and it was because of her experience
with the criminal justice system

00:11:06.733 --> 00:11:08.974
that she realized just how broken it is,

00:11:08.998 --> 00:11:11.771
and she decided to do
something about that.

00:11:11.795 --> 00:11:13.443
So she ran for office,

00:11:13.467 --> 00:11:16.014
and this January, she's going to Congress.

00:11:16.038 --> 00:11:18.019
OK? Or --

00:11:18.043 --> 00:11:19.429
(Applause)

00:11:19.453 --> 00:11:21.866
Angie Craig from Minnesota.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:22.991
(Applause and cheers)

00:11:23.015 --> 00:11:28.968
So her congressman had made
such hateful comments about LGBTQ people

00:11:28.992 --> 00:11:31.184
that she decided to challenge him.